hand 1: 4s 147m 258p 258s 125z
hand 2: 258m 369p 258s 1267z
hand 3: 368m 147p 369s 1237z
dora: 1z 2z
rinshan: 7z
draws: 4z 4z 4z 6z 1s 3z 3z 3z 4s

