0 tsumogiri 4z
1 tsumogiri 4z
2 tsumogiri 4z
3 tsumogiri 6z
assert_furiten 0: false
assert_legal 0: tsumo
assert_legal 0: ankan:1s
0 ankan 1s
0 tsumogiri 7z
1 discard 4s
assert_furiten 0: false
assert_legal 0: ron
window: 0=ron

